CAREERS //

## Join a team built for stewardship

### We’re building for decades, not quarters. If you value clarity, discipline, and doing right by families, you’ll fit here. We pair institutional rigor with human judgment—and we hire for trajectory, integrity, and care.

![Three people sitting at a table in a cafe, engaged in conversation and smiling, with coffee cups and notebooks on the table.](/images/pages/careers/6efd7f14a3-image-gen--23-.webp)

### What we look for (short list):

-   Clear thinkers who write well and explain why
    
-   Process builders who still listen first
    
-   Calm operators under pressure
    
-   Respect for confidentiality and compliance
    

